1xdf|n|of Run ; The act of one who, or of that which runs; as, the running was slow. ; That which runs or flows; the quantity of a liquid which flows in a certain time or during a certain operation; as, the first running of a still. ; The discharge from an ulcer or other sore.	a:8h2,46,3;143o,27,4;18x8,24,17;om2,20,1;1a80,8,1~18x8,24,17;143o,27,4;8h2,46,3;om2,20,1;1a80,8,1	v:1vzz,2,1;24pk,2,12~24pk,2,12;1vzz,2,1	V:1wxz,11,19;2go7,4,11~1wxz,11,19;2go7,4,11	n:a40,64,65;20yv,54,5;20yw,49,5;1trc,35,3;22sj,31,5;100d,29,7;12rz,25,5;12rx,19,8;2hc8,15,1;672,12,1;2bl7,11,4;1lxf,11,22;htc,10,5;1a80,8,1;1iag,3,1~a40,64,65;1lxf,11,22;12rx,19,8;100d,29,7;12rz,25,5;20yv,54,5;22sj,31,5;htc,10,5;20yw,49,5;2bl7,11,4;1trc,35,3;1iag,3,1;2hc8,15,1;672,12,1;1av0,1,1	N:1fn1,100,70;w60,36,10;1j59,21,2;1ehr,17,3;iy9,16,2;xla,14,3;12ln,14,5;12ip,12,2;1a22,9,1;2go7,9,16;2bsj,8,3;1hlc,8,1;iya,4,5;15gy,2,2~1fn1,100,70;2go7,9,16;w60,36,10;12ln,14,5;iya,4,5;2bsj,8,3;1ehr,17,3;xla,14,3;1j59,21,2;15gy,2,2;12ip,12,2;iy9,16,2;1hlc,8,1;1a22,9,1
